WEBVTT

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:13.180
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:12.820
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.880
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.290
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:27.400
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.540
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:37.100
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:41.290
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.360
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.450
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:58.210
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.490
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:05.420
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.870
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:25.180
Takara Fansubs

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:33.440
<i>There was a secret concerning Angeletta's childhood.</i>

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:40.730
<i>Rossi had not told it to anyone in many years.</i>

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.760
<i>Romeo had not caught hint of it yet.</i>

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:52.680
Episode 21:

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:52.680
Angeletta's Secret

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.830
Mrs. Rossi going shopping?

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.470
Yeah. At Santa Maria Marketplace.

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:12.100
Santa Maria? That far?

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:16.770
They won't be back for a while. Convenient for us.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.460
Right. Let's do it!

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:20.410
Right!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.020
Come in.

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:28.780
Angeletta... happy birthday.

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.320
Wow, you remembered.

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.850
Come on, Romeo. Hurry up.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:38.020
Man, she really IS an angel.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:41.210
You're right, she looks just like Maria!

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:45.580
Angeletta, allow me to introduce my friends, the Black Brothers.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.490
So you're...

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:50.850
Let's start by introducing ourselves.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.230
What can I say? I'm the most desired man in all Milan...

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.130
Brave, intelligent, and...

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.080
Did I say something funny?

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:01.890
Pleased to meet you, Dante.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.340
You've heard of me?

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:04.340
Yes.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.070
Well how's that for famous!

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:10.840
We've never even met, and she knows my name.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:16.370
Romeo's always telling me how much fun you are.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.420
Shoot. So that's it.

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:23.600
Uhh... I - I'm...

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.610
Michaelo, right?
Pleased to meet you.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.720
You knew about me too?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.380
Yes. Romeo loves you all like brothers.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.500
I hope we can get along too.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:34.380
Yeah!

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:37.020
Angeletta...

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:41.830
You must be Alfredo. You're exactly how I imagined you to be.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.090
So are you. I've been looking forward to meeting you.

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:55.610
So Angeletta's 11 today.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.300
Time passes so quickly...

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:00.540
To celebrate your birthday we wanted to get you a gift.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.010
But I don't have any money...

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:07.130
So instead we offer you that apple and our Pure Heart.

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.070
Pure Heart?

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:11.520
The Black Brothers' song.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:14.830
Boss!

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:17.690
Please, Father, don't scold them.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:21.020
They came for my birthday!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.410
Absolutely not!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.510
Father!

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:27.760
Not unless you sing that "Pure Heart" song for me.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.320
<i>We're all heroes.</i>

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:37.220
<i>The whole town's in an uproar.</i>

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:44.600
<i>Come on, let's sing our song,</i>

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:49.060
<i>Every day, every night, covered in soot.</i>

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:53.090
<i>Though it's tough in the chimneys,</i>

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:59.590
<i>Come on, let's go!
Our courage is ablaze.</i>

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:03.850
<i>Yes, yes! Yes, yes! Hey!</i>

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:08.030
<i>We're all heroes.</i>

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:14.100
<i>The whole town is our friend.</i>

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:18.330
Angeletta looked really happy!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.630
Maybe sometime we could invite her to our secret base.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.560
Our secret base?

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.510
But what about our oath not to reveal its location to anybody?

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:32.260
Angeletta's one of us now.
I'm sure the others will allow it.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.080
Thanks, Alfredo.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:41.820
What a wonderful birthday that was. It was like a dream.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.760
Wasn't it nice, Angeletta?

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:50.400
Come to think of it,

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.870
...until last year all we did was listen to this music box.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:00.960
Dante, give me a board.

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:03.690
A BOARD, Dante!

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:06.070
What's wrong?

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.940
Something's definitely fishy.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:09.730
About what?

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:15.770
How a cutie like Angeletta could have been born...

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:20.860
...to a couple like Rossi and that wife of his.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:24.450
I've had a good look with my own two eyes.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.300
My guess is... Angeletta's not Rossi's child.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.900
Are you serious, Dante?
- Yeah.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:34.460
There's some secret behind it all.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:37.460
And my padrone SHOULD be in on it.

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:38.800
Hold it, Padrone.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.010
Is that true?

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.590
Well... uh...

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:46.580
Of course it's true. Someone of his great stature MUST know.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.590
Great stature? Me?

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.500
Why, that Rossi's a nobody compared to you.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:56.740
Exactly! And that jerk had the nerve to forbid me to say anything about it.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:57.430
He forbade you?

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:58.790
Uhh... yeah.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.870
We won't say anything to Rossi.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.190
You sure?

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.040
I give you my word.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:10.170
Heh... I've been itching for ten years to tell somebody...

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.830
Angeletta's mysterious secret!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.580
Mysterious secret?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:15.770
That's right!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.000
The story of Angeletta's birth is a long-lost secret.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:25.460
Yes... it was one day, ten years ago.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.730
An unseasonable springtime snow was falling.

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:33.750
I saw a fancy carriage stopped in front of Rossi's house.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:37.390
It was a carriage of a certain Countess.

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:45.830
You don't seriously mean to...

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.210
Lady Isabella!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.240
Lady Isabella!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:08:00.490
Why did the Countess leave that baby with Rossi?

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:07.870
Rossi would never explain why.

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:20.990
But I can say this for sure:
Angeletta is the Count's daughter.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:39.660
I'm stepping out for a while.

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:41.950
Father...

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.970
Today is the day you visit the mansion?

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:51.380
Once every year you go visit Grandmother Isabella.

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.160
Well... that's right.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:01.720
But how did you know, Angeletta?

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.210
By the suit you're wearing.
- Suit?

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:09.150
Every birthday you put on that same suit and go out somewhere.

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:13.530
Also, when you come back, Mother is always in a good mood.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:15.320
So that's how you knew.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.370
Father...

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:20.390
Be sure and tell her I had a wonderful day...

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:24.380
And that I talk with her in my heart,

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:32.400
...whenever I play her music box.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:35.860
I will.

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:44.370
You'll meet her someday. I'm sure.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:12.610
<i>The boss is going to the Count's mansion.</i>

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:26.600
Romeo.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:34.560
<i>I have to tell her today.</i>

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:52.720
<i>But why is he going there?</i>

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.290
I've come to see the Lady.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.850
Oh, it's you. Go on in.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:39.030
I know, Piccolo... I want to know what he's doing too, but...

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:45.620
I can't just walk in there.

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.630
Let's go home.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:56.800
Quickly! Go get somebody who can clean a chimney.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:58.490
Clean a chimney?

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:04.070
The kitchen stove is stopped up and the smoke won't go out the chimney.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.140
Spatza camino!

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.500
Want your chimney cleaned?

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:11.120
Spatza camino!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.720
Hey, over here!

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:16.440
Right away, Sir!

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.830
Unbelievable!

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.200
This way.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.260
Oh... OK!

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:36.030
Whoa, what a big vase.

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:37.550
Something, isn't it?

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:39.910
Whose mansion is this?

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:42.200
Countess Montoverni.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:44.910
Countess Montoverni.

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:49.120
The Montoverni name has been distinguished in Milan for centuries.

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:53.270
Now hurry up, or we'll get scolded by the Lady.

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:54.370
The Lady?

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:56.660
You don't know anything, do you?

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:59.840
Lady Isabella, mistress of the house.

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.050
Isabella?

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:06.820
Once every year you go visit Grandmother Isabella.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:10.020
<i>Countess Isabella Montoverni.</i>

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:11.780
<i>So she's Angeletta's...</i>

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:16.390
Of course, people call her the "Ice Queen".

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:25.740
It's been eleven years since Lady Isabella's son Adolf died.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.340
When will she decide on her successor?

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.350
Truly.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:32.740
Whose head shall bear the glory of the Montoverni's?

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:36.950
Might you be among those seeking to gain favor to become successor?

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:41.830
The one who becomes the Ice Queen's favorite wins.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:47.510
If we use the new silverware for the Grand Duke's wedding,

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:52.520
...the Montoverni name will be tarnished.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:54.060
Deepest apologies, Madam.

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:56.510
Send away to Paris for something immediately.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:57.850
Yes, Madam.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:01.950
Madam, Rossi has been waiting for some time.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:05.430
Rossi? Send him in.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.140
Yes, Madam.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:13.370
How are you today, Lady Isabella?

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:15.620
We thought we'd drop by again, Lady Isabella.

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:18.240
How's it look?

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:21.130
It's fine. I'll be done soon.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:24.830
Please finish before Lady Isabella finds out.

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:32.190
Lady Isabella, you are the pride of the Montoverni household.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.170
No mistake. You're ever the beauty...

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:45.640
B-Bacchus, when will you make friends with me?

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:50.400
Yes, I care about the Countess with all my heart.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:52.620
There, be a good boy...

00:14:55.640 --> 00:15:00.820
What will I do without you, Bacchus?
You always see into my heart.

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:04.150
Bacchus never makes friends with any person he knows I dislike.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.650
Let me warn you two right now...

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.110
no person dishonest with himself

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:17.950
...can hope to inherit the Montoverni title.

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:21.450
Why, Lady Isabella...

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:23.550
We haven't done any...

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:30.050
Well, it looks like Bacchus is in a bad mood today.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:36.000
Excuse us. We'll be going now!

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:46.210
I'm happy to see you're doing well, Madam.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:51.190
I see that babyface of yours hasn't changed in all these thirty years.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:54.140
Piccolo! Where are you? Piccolo!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.710
Please find him quickly.
- Yes.

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:03.110
If she finds out a strange animal is loose in the mansion...

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.610
...what will Madam say?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.100
Piccolo, get out here!

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:12.700
Piccolo!

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:21.120
Piccolo, where'd you go?

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.280
This place is so huge I don't know where to start.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:36.240
I - I'm not a thief.
My name is Romeo.

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:40.870
I'm going, okay?

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:46.070
<i>Calm down.</i>

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.860
Shoo! Go away!

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:13.980
Bacchus. Be quiet.
Madam is with a guest.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.690
Phew. That was scary...

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.590
Piccolo! There you are!

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:37.520
You shouldn't have done that.
This isn't our house, you know.

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.730
Silly guy.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:50.370
He looks just like someone...

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:57.860
Angeletta! He looks like Angeletta!

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:59.670
The eyes are exactly the same.

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:01.100
Could they be...

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.940
Count Adolf!

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:21.450
How old would he be now if he were still alive?

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:24.420
He looks exactly like you, Madam.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:27.510
And... Angeletta...
- Stop it.

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:33.190
Yes, Madam.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:37.690
This year's portion. To pay for Angeletta's living expenses.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.830
Thank you.

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:41.790
Thanks are not necessary.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:45.930
I'm merely fulfilling my duty towards my granddaughter.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.480
Duty, eh?

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.060
What is it?

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:58.010
Madam, I have a favor to ask.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.050
So ask.

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:02.470
Well...

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:06.520
I understand. How much more do you need?

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:07.800
That's not it!

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:12.450
That's not it, Madam.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:15.850
I'm just asking you to meet Angeletta. Just once.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:22.940
It's been years since she found out about her past...

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:27.750
Angeletta would never say anything, but I can tell...

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:35.220
She wants to meet Lady Isabella...
She wants to meet her grandmother.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.200
Today is her birthday.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.210
I'd like to be able to offer her the gift of telling her...

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:45.450
..."Today you're going to meet your grandmother."

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:51.310
Madam, think of it as a favor to a friend of thirty years.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:54.070
Please meet her.

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:03.700
<i>Boss...!</i>

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.900
There is no need to meet her.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:14.500
So, Angeletta has set her sights on the Monteverni estate.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.560
Madam!

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:18.660
Adolf was indeed Angeletta's father,

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:21.770
...but her mother was not of the aristocracy.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:25.080
I advise you to recall that difference in social position.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:30.080
I have no intention of naming that child as the Montoverni heiress.

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:36.190
Now take this and leave.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:38.880
Please wait!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.740
Romeo?

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:45.000
Angeletta doesn't care about money.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.300
Stop it, Romeo!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:51.070
Boss, Angeletta isn't like that! She's so nice...

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:54.970
Everybody loves her! How can she...

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:55.850
And you are?

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:59.990
Romeo. I work for Padrone Rossi.

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:04.250
This is no place for you. Get out.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:10.040
No! Angeletta isn't out to get your estate.

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:14.120
She has a pure heart.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:15.690
Pure heart?

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:16.480
Yes!

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:20.690
What an odd boy.

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:26.400
How will you prove to me that she has a 'pure heart'?

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:28.100
I'll wager my life on it.

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:33.270
If you wish to go that far, then very well - prove it...

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:36.210
...with your life!

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.210
Madam!

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:57.900
<i>Angeletta's condition is getting worse every day,</i>

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:01.880
<i>...but Lady Isabella still refuses to meet her.</i>

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:05.650
<i>Let's go see your grandmother, Angeletta.</i>

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:09.890
See you then!

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:09.890
<i>I Meet Grandmother</i>

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:09.890
Next time:

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:16.740
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:25.350 --> 00:22:29.450
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:33.750
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:33.950 --> 00:22:37.950
<i>Si Si Ciao, we're all friends</i>

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:47.060
<i>Your laughing voice dances</i>

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:50.960
<i>Once again in the sky</i>

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:58.260
<i>Your pocket bursting with memories</i>

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:03.860
<i>Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now</i>

00:23:04.060 --> 00:23:08.060
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>
